   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1   a user can post text, an image or a video\n\n2   a user can follow / unfollow anyone\n\n3   a user opens the app and sees a feed of posts\n     from the people they follow, newest first\n\n4   a user can like and comment on a post\n\n5   a user can search for people, posts and hashtags\n\n6   a user gets a live alert when someone likes,\n     comments or follows them\n\n7   nice to have: trending hashtags, stories, DMs",
   "originalText": "1   a user can post text, an image or a video\n\n2   a user can follow / unfollow anyone\n\n3   a user opens the app and sees a feed of posts\n     from the people they follow, newest first\n\n4   a user can like and comment on a post\n\n5   a user can search for people, posts and hashtags\n\n6   a user gets a live alert when someone likes,\n     comments or follows them\n\n7   nice to have: trending hashtags, stories, DMs",
   "fontSize": 13,
