   "updated": 1787160000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "POST    /v1/posts                    { text, mediaKey }   ->  postId\nGET     /v1/upload-url?type=image      ->  a short lived S3 link the phone uploads to\nGET     /v1/feed?cursor=<c>&limit=20   ->  [ posts ] + nextCursor    never a page number\nGET     /v1/users/{id}/posts?cursor=<c>    ->  that person's wall\nPOST    /v1/users/{id}/follow     |   DELETE  /v1/users/{id}/follow\nPOST    /v1/posts/{id}/like       |   DELETE  /v1/posts/{id}/like\nPOST    /v1/posts/{id}/comments      { text }\nGET     /v1/posts/{id}/comments?cursor=<c>\nGET     /v1/search?q=<q>&type=post|user|tag\nWS      /v1/notifications              ->  the live like / comment / follow alerts",
   "originalText": "POST    /v1/posts                    { text, mediaKey }   ->  postId\nGET     /v1/upload-url?type=image      ->  a short lived S3 link the phone uploads to\nGET     /v1/feed?cursor=<c>&limit=20   ->  [ posts ] + nextCursor    never a page number\nGET     /v1/users/{id}/posts?cursor=<c>    ->  that person's wall\nPOST    /v1/users/{id}/follow     |   DELETE  /v1/users/{id}/follow\nPOST    /v1/posts/{id}/like       |   DELETE  /v1/posts/{id}/like\nPOST    /v1/posts/{id}/comments      { text }\nGET     /v1/posts/{id}/comments?cursor=<c>\nGET     /v1/search?q=<q>&type=post|user|tag\nWS      /v1/notifications              ->  the live like / comment / follow alerts",
   "fontSize": 13,
