   "updated": 1787160000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "EVENTS ON IT\n\n- post created\n- post deleted\n- follow added\n- like added\n- comment added\n- user activity\n- notification",
   "originalText": "EVENTS ON IT\n\n- post created\n- post deleted\n- follow added\n- like added\n- comment added\n- user activity\n- notification",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "roundness": null
  },
  {
   "id": "e127",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1496,
   "y": 940,
   "width": 125.84,
   "height": 192.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "seed": 149386144,
   "version": 100,
   "versionNonce": 1423794398,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1787160000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- all events of one\n  user go to the same\n  partition, so they\n  stay in order\n\n- an event can arrive\n  twice, so every\n  reader is written to\n  ignore repeats\n\n- kept for 7 days, so\n  a broken reader can\n  replay instead of\n  losing data",
   "originalText": "- all events of one\n  user go to the same\n  partition, so they\n  stay in order\n\n- an event can arrive\n  twice, so every\n  reader is written to\n  ignore repeats\n\n- kept for 7 days, so\n  a broken reader can\n  replay instead of\n  losing data",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
